        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Single photo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endpoint von %@ übernommen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Endpoint taken over from %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entfernen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erkennungsmodell entfernt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detection model removed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erkennungsmodell ist da.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detection model is ready."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erscheinungsbild": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appearance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es ist kein Foto kodiert.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No photo has been encoded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es kamen %lld Vektoren für %lld Texte zurück.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld vectors came back for %lld texts."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Es kamen %1$lld Vektoren für %2$lld Texte zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es schreibt — %lld Zeichen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It is writing — %lld characters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es werden %lld Fotos gleichzeitig gelesen. In den Einstellungen änderbar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld photos are read at once. Changeable in the settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Farbe, Größe, Zustand …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Colour, size, condition …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feld `data` fehlt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Field `data` is missing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feld `embedding` fehlt oder ist keine Zahlenreihe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Field `embedding` is missing or not a list of numbers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fertig": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fotografiere ein Regal, eine Schublade, eine Kiste. Dein Modell liest, was darauf ist, und du hakst ab, was stimmt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photograph a shelf, a drawer, a box. Your model reads what is on it, and you tick off what is right."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fotografieren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photograph"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fotos kommen in eine Reihe und werden nebeneinander gelesen. Mehr gleichzeitig heisst frueher fertig — bis der Anbieter drosselt. Wer 429 oder Zeitablaeufe sieht, stellt es herunter. Die Reihe fasst %lld Aufnahmen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos go into a queue and are read side by side. More at once means finished sooner — until the provider throttles. If you see 429s or timeouts, turn it down. The queue holds %lld photos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fotos: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fundus": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fundus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fundus darf nicht auf die Kamera. Das lässt sich in den Einstellungen des Geräts unter Fundus ändern.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fundus is not allowed to use the camera. You can change that in the device's Settings under Fundus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ganzes Bild": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whole image"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gegenstaende erkennen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detect objects"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gegenstand": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Object"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gelesen von %@. Was du übernimmst, behält das als Herkunft und dieses Foto als Beleg.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read by %@. Whatever you accept keeps that as its origin and this photo as the evidence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gemeinsamer Ordner der eigenhand-Apps (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shared folder of the eigenhand apps (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Genauer, kostet aber bei jeder Suche eine Anfrage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "More precise, but costs a request on every search."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gesehen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gewählt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chosen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gewählt: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selected: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gilt für die Oberfläche. Systemdialoge — etwa die Frage nach der Kamera — folgen weiterhin der Spracheinstellung des Geräts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to the interface. System dialogs — the camera prompt, for instance — still follow the device's language setting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gleichzeitig lesen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read at once"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP %lld\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "HTTP %1$lld\n%2$@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP %lld\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP %lld — das sagt nichts über Bilder aus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP %lld — that says nothing about images."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hell": {
